          </div>
          <div>
            <p class="font-label text-primary font-bold text-sm mb-2">CONSUMABLES</p>
            <p class="font-body text-on-surface text-sm">Tape, bubble wrap, PE bags</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <section class="mb-12">
        <h2 class="font-headline text-2xl font-bold text-on-surface mb-6">Reseller Programme FAQs</h2>
        <div class="space-y-4">
          <details class="group border border-outline-variant/20 rounded-lg p-4">
            <summary class="font-label font-bold text-on-surface cursor-pointer">Is there a real market for packaging at kedai runcit?</summary>
            <p class="font-body text-on-surface text-sm mt-3 leading-relaxed">Yes — 10-30 boxes a week per shop, multiplied across your route. Adds up faster than you'd expect.</p>
          </details>
          <details class="group border border-outline-variant/20 rounded-lg p-4">
            <summary class="font-label font-bold text-on-surface cursor-pointer">What margin can I expect?</summary>
            <p class="font-body text-on-surface text-sm mt-3 leading-relaxed">25-40% on carton boxes; similar on consumables. Higher because per-unit price tolerance is broader at small volumes.</p>
          </details>
          <details class="group border border-outline-variant/20 rounded-lg p-4">
            <summary class="font-label font-bold text-on-surface cursor-pointer">Minimum to start?</summary>
            <p class="font-body text-on-surface text-sm mt-3 leading-relaxed">RM 1,000 wholesale minimum. Most start with RM 2,000-5,000 stock and a small van.</p>
          </details>
          <details class="group border border-outline-variant/20 rounded-lg p-4">
            <summary class="font-label font-bold text-on-surface cursor-pointer">Do you offer credit terms?</summary>
            <p class="font-body text-on-surface text-sm mt-3 leading-relaxed">Cash for first 3-6 months; credit considered with track record.</p>
          </details>
          <details class="group border border-outline-variant/20 rounded-lg p-4">
            <summary class="font-label font-bold text-on-surface cursor-pointer">Plain or printed boxes?</summary>
            <p class="font-body text-on-surface text-sm mt-3 leading-relaxed">Plain kraft sells fastest. Generic 'KEEP DRY' print available as a small premium upsell.</p>
          </details>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="mb-12 bg-primary/5 border border-primary/20 rounded-lg p-8">
        <h2 class="font-headline text-2xl font-bold text-on-surface mb-4">Start Your Reseller Route from Balakong Stock</h2>
        <p class="font-body text-on-surface leading-relaxed mb-6">Quinocycle has supplied independent packaging resellers across Selangor for over a decade. Wholesale pricing, regular dispatch, and a proven product mix that moves through small retail shops.</p>
