        <h2 class="font-headline text-2xl font-bold text-on-surface mb-4">Conclusion: The Boring Route Is the Profitable Route</h2>
        <p class="font-body text-on-surface leading-relaxed mb-4">Reseller success in this segment isn't about huge orders — it's about consistency. Show up every Tuesday with the right stock, charge fair, and a 50-shop route becomes a viable side business or full-time income within 12 months.</p>
        <p class="font-body text-on-surface leading-relaxed">WhatsApp Quinocycle to discuss reseller pricing and a starter stock plan tailored to your territory.</p>
